# InitechDOS manuals: shipped items with no entry yet, established 2026-10-16.
# NAME|date|reason. Remove each row when its reference entry lands; the gate
# forbids growth against HEAD and HEAD^ and rejects stale rows.
# 2026-10-17 (lane/dosman integration): 24 rows removed -- the InitechDOS
# Reference documents them (ATTRIB BREAK CD CHDIR CHKDSK CLS DATE ECHO ERASE
# EXIT LABEL MD MKDIR PROMPT RD REN RENAME RMDIR SET TIME TREE VER VOL XCOPY);
# EDLIN got its Reference entry in the same pass.
# !!! GROWTH, PM-directed 2026-10-17: TEXT (APPS\TEXT.EXE, InitechText) joined
# !!! the shipped volume after the pilot rows were dated; like CALC and WORD it
# !!! is a FLAIR application for its own manual (initech-ipu5.11), not a DOS
# !!! command, so it is listed here explicitly rather than in the DOS books.
# !!! GROWTH, PM-directed 2026-10-17: PAINT (APPS\PAINT.EXE, InitechPaint, the bar
# !!! carrier of initech-tdnl.20) likewise -- a FLAIR application for its own manual.
# !!! GROWTH, PM-directed 2026-10-17: TPSREP (APPS\TPSREP.COM, the TPS Report Generator)
# !!! shipped on the flagship volume with the Exit-to-InitechDOS journey (initech-3p1a); it is
# !!! documented by its own Operating Procedures manual (initech-ipu5.14), not the DOS books.
# !!! GROWTH, PM-directed 2026-10-17: CALCULAT (APPS\CALCULAT.EXE, the Calculator desk
# !!! accessory under the Apple menu, initech-tdnl.17) is a FLAIR desk accessory for the
# !!! Finder manual (initech-ipu5.9), not a DOS command.
